      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِقْصَرَةٌ</span></b>  (M, K) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَرَةٌ</span></b>  (M, TA) The <i>wooden
